  "summary_en": "Ontario regulation establishing a ten-year pilot project allowing testing of Level 3–5 automated commercial motor vehicles on highways, subject to Registrar approval, $10 million insurance, driver and failsafe requirements, collision reporting within 24 hours, and record retention.",
